    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. i've checked the saw height and it seems fine. i'm also using very sharp chisels, but i still feel like i'm fighting the wood at those specific corners. do you think it could be the grain pattern itself, or maybe something about how i'm approaching the chisel angle when I'm cleaning out the waste?",
